-- Sloping aquifer style CO2STORE gas-water test based on CO2STORE_GW.DATA.
-- The grid is flat in Cartesian geometry, and the depth ramp is applied in the
-- EDIT section so that the aquifer/reservoir depth decreases by 5% over the
-- model length, starting at 1000 at X = 1.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUNSPEC
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
TITLE
   CO2STORE GAS-WATER SLOPING DEPTH

DIMENS 
99 1 10 /

EQLDIMS
/

TABDIMS
/

WATER
GAS
CO2STORE
--DISGASW
--VAPWAT

METRIC

START
   1 'JAN' 2019 /

WELLDIMS
   2 10 1 2 /

UNIFIN
UNIFOUT

----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GRID
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

NOECHO

INIT

DX 
  990*101.01010101 /

DY 
  990*100 /

DZ 
  990*5 /

TOPS
  990*1000.0 /

PORO 
  990*0.3/

PERMX 
  990*2000/

PERMY
  990*2000/
  
PERMZ 
  990*2000/

-- 5% sloping aquifer
EDIT
ADD
